                  <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;MED files are useful to visualize results in ParaView. Creating them can take a lot of time for large models, and they may take a lot of memory space. The sleepers, whose results are printed to the MED files are selected in the &amp;quot;Simulation setup&amp;quot; tab.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
